      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Yoshida et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Mycobacterium pseudoshottsii is a fish pathogen that produces mycolactone. Here, we report the complete chromosome sequence of a type strain of M. pseudoshottsii (JCM 15466). The sequence will represent essential data for future phylogenetic and comparative genome studies of mycolactone-producing mycobacteria."
